 "notes": "Volume (3 pp.): title page, then the statement (p.2) that the entities recognized under art. 14 a) of Ley 4763 of 6 Jan 1930 (Partido Conservador, Partido Liberal Unificado, Partido Radical, Partido Demócrata, Confederación Republicana de Acción Cívica) presented exactly as many candidates as seats, so the Tribunal Calificador by sentence of 9 April 1930 proclaimed them without a vote. Only the four circunscripciones provinciales renewed in 1930 appear (2.a, 4.a, 6.a, 8.a), five senators each; contest numbers are the printed circunscripción ordinals. No votes, registered voters, election day or party affiliations are printed. Each contest has one pseudo-list 'Candidatos proclamados sin votación' with votes null."
